  "description": "The Mushroom Climber is an arched overhead ladder in Play Red and Play Yellow, with a small bird figure as a decorative touch. Children climb the curve from one end, move along the rungs over the top of the arch and come down the far side. Because the rungs rise and then fall, each crossing feels different from a flat set of bars. At only 1'6\" wide and 13'6\" long, it slots along the edge of a garden or between two larger pieces. Plan a safe play area of 18'6\" x 6'6\" around it. The galvanised frame and roto-moulded parts come with our 3-year warranty. Ask us to show where it would sit on your play area layout.",
